elp us rebuild?", "head": [36911, 37061], "body": [37139, 37719], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "6378yh", "n": 19, "items": 3, "chars": 113, "words": 20, "title": "Help Mexico against UK! This is what they are planing to do on our territory", "head": [37797, 37928], "body": [38006, 38297], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "6386pc", "n": 20, "items": 10, "chars": 2225, "words": 226, "title": "An updated version of the program that plays the drums for you - check the comments.", "head": [38375, 38517], "body": [38595, 41595], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "6389y4", "n": 21, "items": 11, "chars": 906, "words": 172, "title": "RIP in peace, sombrero duck. You died too young.", "head": [41673, 42394], "body": [42472, 44000], "has_window": true}, {"tid": "638mq0", "n": 22, "items": 4, "chars": 522, "words": 99, "title": "Gentlemen, it has been a honor to fight beside you. From your friends on r/mexico", "head": [44078, 44214], "body": [44292, 44996], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "639dq5", "n": 23, "items": 6, "chars": 500, "words": 99, "title": "Hi guys! This is the last photo I took of M\u00e9xico and our friends! Thanks for being such nice people.", "head": [45074, 45846], "body": [45924, 46743], "has_window": true}, {"tid": "63bi1y", "n": 24, "items": 18, "chars": 285, "words": 40, "title": "Hi im new", "head": [46821, 47503], "body": [47581, 48943], "has_window": true}, {"tid": "5xfsjp", "n": 25, "items": 1, "chars": 7, "words": 2, "title": "(this thread's opening post falls outside the window; the items below are in-window replies to a post you cannot see)", "head": [49021, 49190], "body": [49268, 49338], "has_window": false}, {"tid": "59pb8d", "n": 26, "items": 1, "chars": 3, "words": 1, "title": "(this thread's opening post falls outside the window; the items below are in-window replies to a post you cannot see)", "head": [49416, 49585], "body": [49663, 49730], "has_window": false}], "items": {"62kj56": [9013, 9185], "dfn8mqq": [9185, 9541], "dfn8z3l": [9541, 9656], "